      "Freeway and river polylines reserve open corridors (no fabric) of the given width: these become the deep glowing traffic trenches.",
      "Landmarks reserve their footprint (reserveRadius) so procedural fabric never intersects them.",
      "See docs/BIBLE.md for the evidence and reasoning behind every number.",
      "Each district has a traffic weight from 0 to 1. Ground traffic scales its street budget by that weight. The coast, K and Wallace stay off the street graph."
    ]
